crime-assist-sophont-explanation =
    Space Law binds every sapient being on Nanotrasen property. A sapient being (istota rozumna) is anyone able to understand and follow these rules.
    Animals and other non-sapient creatures are not persons under PK. Harming them with malice is §204 property damage, not assault.
    Same _XX categories do not stack — charge the heaviest article. Different _XX categories add. Over 35 minutes, permabrig is recommended.
